<h1>About Robux Tax Calculator</h1>
<p>Robux Tax Calculator is an independent set of free calculators for Roblox creators. It exists because pricing an item, estimating a payout and converting Robux into your own currency are three separate calculations, and most people do them in their head.</p>
<h2>What we build</h2>
<p>A <a href="/">Robux tax calculator</a> that works in both directions, plus converters for <a href="/robux-to-usd-calculator">US dollars</a> and several other currencies. Everything runs in your browser and nothing needs an account.</p>
<h2>How we keep numbers honest</h2>
<p>Fees and DevEx rates live in one configuration file, separate from the page text. When Roblox changes its terms, a single edit updates every calculator. Where a figure is not confirmed, the site says so rather than guessing.</p>
<h2>What we are not</h2>
<p>We are not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by Roblox. Results are estimates, not financial or tax advice. If you spot an error, <a href="/contact">tell us</a>.</p>
